{
  "analysis": "I'm in the /workspace directory. I can see there are several files including assets folder, expected_config.json, gen_inputs.py, presence_plan.txt, setup.sh, skill_context folder, and task_marker.txt. I need to explore these files to understand the clawd-presence system and what needs to be configured.",
  "plan": "First, I'll explore the workspace structure to understand the clawd-presence system. I'll read the presence_plan.txt, expected_config.json, and explore the skill_context folder to understand the requirements. Then I'll look at the assets folder and the main source files.",
  "commands": [
